; =====================================================================
;  Ledgerble Demo Journal — "The Burrow Books of Gerald T. Gerbil"
; =====================================================================
;
;  A full year (2024) of made-up finances for a financially-savvy
;  gerbil. It exercises every part of Ledgerble:
;
;    * Income      — salary, freelance burrow design, dividends
;    * Expenses    — many categories for the treemap / category views
;    * Assets      — checking, savings, a little foreign cash
;    * Liabilities — credit card + a student loan
;    * Equity      — opening balances
;    * Portfolio   — shares & crypto with evolving market prices,
;                    showing unrealized gains AND a loser
;    * Currencies  — a EUR pocket for a trip abroad
;
;  Base currency is USD ($). Open it in Ledgerble and click through the
;  Overview, Categories, Balance, Assets, Portfolio and Postings tabs.
;
;  (Yes, the gerbil invests in vegetables. No, we will not explain.)
; =====================================================================


